      "returns": {
        "type": "tensor",
        "dtype": "torch.float32",
        "device": "cuda",
        "shape": "[batch, channels, out_depth, out_height, out_width] computed as floor((input_size + 2*padding - kernel_size)/stride)+1"
      },
      "semantics": [
        "对应参考语句 x = self.avg_pool3d(x)，其中 AvgPool3d 配置为 kernel_size=(2,3,3), stride=(2,3,3), padding=0。",
        "对每个输出位置 (b,c,d,h,w)，对输入中所有 kernel 范围内的元素求平均，即 sum(x[b,c,d*stride_depth+i, h*stride_height+j, w*stride_width+k]) / (kernel_depth*kernel_height*kernel_width)，其中 i 从 0 到 kernel_depth-1，j 从 0 到 kernel_height-1，k 从 0 到 kernel_width-1。",
        "输出尺寸 floor((input_dim + 2*padding - kernel_size)/stride)+1，本例为 depth: floor((512-2)/2)+1=256, height: floor((128-3)/3)+1=42, width: floor((128-3)/3)+1=42。",
        "输入为 CUDA float32 张量，输出为 CUDA float32 张量，支持任意 strides。",
        "本算子不包含 bias，纯平均池化。"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "reference_steps": [
    {
      "checkpoint": "step_001",
      "source": "x = self.avg_pool3d(x)",
      "semantics": [
        "应用 AvgPool3d 平均池化，kernel_size=(2,3,3), stride=(2,3,3), padding=0。",
        "输出形状 [16,3,256,42,42]，dtype float32，device cuda:0。",
        "结果赋给 x，作为后续返回。"
      ]
    },
